  "title": "Hyrox 60-minute AMRAP: run, sled pull, run, farmers carry",
  "creator": "Greg Williams (Rox Lyfe)",
  "description": "An hour-long aerobic session from Rox Lyfe's training-plan fundamentals: as many rounds as possible of a 500 m run, 40 m sled pull, 500 m run and 100 m farmers carry. It targets the two stations most people are weakest at while teaching you to run on tired legs. Keep the runs at a steady race-ish pace rather than sprinting.",
